  m_text: 'At UnMerryChristmas, we believe games should be welcoming and playable
    by as many people

    as possible.

    We are committed to designing an inclusive
    sandbox puzzle experience that

    accommodates a wide range of abilities,
    preferences, and play styles.


    This statement outlines:

    the accessibility
    features currently available in UnMerryChristmas and our ongoing efforts to improve.

'
