  m_text: 'Customizable Controls - Fully remappable keyboard and mouse controls.
    Support for alternative input devices where compatible.

    

    Visual Accessibility
    - Optional visual indicators for interactive objects and puzzle elements.


    Audio
    Accessibility - Independent volume controls (music, effects, dialogue). Visual
    feedback for important sound-based events.


    Cognitive Accessibility - Puzzle
    hints. Clear, consistent UI layout and iconography. Ability to pause gameplay
    at any time, including during puzzle interactions.'
